# Comments

Comments are ignored by JavaScript and are used to explain code.

## Single-line Comment

```javascript
// This is a single-line comment
console.log("Hello");
```

## Multi-line Comment

```javascript
/*
This is
a multi-line
comment
*/
console.log("JavaScript");
```

