# Console

The console is mainly used for testing and debugging JavaScript.

```javascript
console.log("Hello World");
```

Output:

```
Hello World
```

Other useful console methods:

```javascript
console.log("Normal message");
console.warn("Warning message");
console.error("Error message");
console.table([
    {name: "Harshit", age: 19},
    {name: "Rahul", age: 20}
]);
```

